            "no releases"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "explain": "Findings with fixes plus SLAs by severity — the review that unblocks. The Hands-on procedure’s review step."
        },
        {
          "q": "STRIDE’s ‘S’ — spoofing — is best countered by…",
          "choices": [
            "backups",
            "strong authentication: proving the entity is who it claims to be",
            "encryption at rest",
